{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beginning of the game you wake up in space and an unknown entity sends you to explore mysterious locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > project_Structure_01 is a first-person exploration game that takes a minimalist approach to storytelling and gameplay, instead focusing on immersing the player within a captivating and introspective environmental experience. Eschewing traditional narrative conventions, the game invites players to navigate a series of surreal liminal spaces imbued with a unique atmosphere and brutalist architectural style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the project_Structure_01 experience is a profound sense of exploration and discovery. Players must traverse the game's meticulously crafted environments, which blend elements of haunting ambience and soothing tranquility. The soundscape seamlessly enhances the player's sense of presence, complementing the visual and spatial design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Through its minimalist approach and focus on environmental immersion, project_Structure_01 offers a contemplative and deeply engaging exploration experience. Players are invited to become lost in the game's captivating liminal spaces, allowing the atmosphere and architectural design to guide their journey of discovery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> <br>\u318dHaunting and relaxing ambient tracks <br>\u318dLiminal spaces experience from first-person perspective <br>\u318dOccasional 3D platforming sections <br>\u318dFun optional collectibles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am solo developer and i created this over the timespan of little bit under 2 years. This is my first game so, assume it to be far from perfect. I still think fans of walking sims who are into brutalist architecture, megastructures and liminal spaces will enjoy their time here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3156820?t=1772793613","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3156820?t=1772793613","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156820/9402479df26353adafc33bd12d4610536d8113d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772793613","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156820/9402479df26353adafc33bd12d4610536d8113d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772793613","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3183050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beginning of the game you wake up in space and an unknown entity sends you to explore mysterious locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > project_Structure_01 is a first-person exploration game that takes a minimalist approach to storytelling and gameplay, instead focusing on immersing the player within a captivating and introspective environmental experience. Eschewing traditional narrative conventions, the game invites players to navigate a series of surreal liminal spaces imbued with a unique atmosphere and brutalist architectural style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the project_Structure_01 experience is a profound sense of exploration and discovery. Players must traverse the game's meticulously crafted environments, which blend elements of haunting ambience and soothing tranquility. The soundscape seamlessly enhances the player's sense of presence, complementing the visual and spatial design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Through its minimalist approach and focus on environmental immersion, project_Structure_01 offers a contemplative and deeply engaging exploration experience. Players are invited to become lost in the game's captivating liminal spaces, allowing the atmosphere and architectural design to guide their journey of discovery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> <br>\u318dHaunting and relaxing ambient tracks <br>\u318dLiminal spaces experience from first-person perspective <br>\u318dOccasional 3D platforming sections <br>\u318dFun optional collectibles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am solo developer and i created this over the timespan of little bit under 2 years. This is my first game so, assume it to be far from perfect. I still think fans of walking sims who are into brutalist architecture, megastructures and liminal spaces will enjoy their time here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Vesa H\u00e4rk\u00f6nen"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156820/header.jpg?t=1772793613","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"project_Structure_01 uses Unreal\u00ae Engine. Unreal\u00ae is a trademark or registered trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States of America and elsewhere. Unreal\u00ae Engine, Copyright 1998 \u2013 2026, Epic Games, Inc. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nThis product is not authored, sponsored, or supported by Epic Games, Inc. Epic Games, Inc. makes no representations, warranties, or conditions, express or implied, with respect to Unreal\u00ae Engine or its use in this product, including, without limitation, any implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Epic Games, Inc. shall have no liability for any claims, damages, losses, or expenses arising out of or related to this product or the use of Unreal\u00ae Engine.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/st